PREAMBLE

This source code is published for transparency, study, and academic reference
only. It is NOT open source. It is NOT free software. The Software is the
proprietary work of ResinCore Team ("ResinCore") and forms the core of
the AURORAZ Digital Lifeform AI ecosystem.

ResinCore makes this source code visible because we believe an AI system that
holds your memories, your character data, and runs in your home should be
auditable. You should be able to read every line that touches your data.

But "readable" is not "usable". The rights granted below are intentionally
narrow.

If you want to use, modify, deploy, or build a product on top of this
Software, you must obtain a separate license. Contact: golf@resincore.ai

